-- WoW Forever (1.60) quest and vendor fixes, 2026-11-11.
-- Only rows backed by captures of the live Forever client (builds 70862/70888) are included; every statement is
-- guarded (insert only when the key is absent, update only when the old value is still present), so running the
-- file again changes nothing. One transaction.
-- Sources (public, credited per GPL-3.0 / CC BY 4.0 terms):
--  * EG Link by Efficient Games: Data from Efficient Games (https://efficient.games), licensed under CC BY 4.0
--    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changed: selected per row and written as TrinityCore rows.
--    Used for: objectives, objective counts, rewards, follow-ups, texts, vendor lists, creature/object templates.
--  * Everlake world data (https://github.com/buildthehomelab/wow-everlake-world-data), GPL-3.0: public Forever data
--    import used as a cross-check and row selection aid; rows were re-checked and rewritten, not copied as files.
--  * Questie (https://github.com/Questie/Questie), GPL-3.0: Forever quest giver / turn-in trace (extra starters/enders).
--  Game content such as names and text belongs to Blizzard Entertainment.
-- Not included: estimated loot, trainer ranks, placeholder scripts, rows needing NPCs/items absent from the client
-- data (e.g. quest 2987 choice item 287073), and quests that need a different world baseline.
-- Requires a world server restart (new creature and gameobject templates).
SET NAMES utf8mb4;
START TRANSACTION;
